      "description": "OPS Recreation - Pool - Pensacola - Main Campus, Florida, United States My settings Life at UWF About UWF UWF News Pensacola Area Benefits Wellness Program Search Jobs Job Alerts Faculty Jobs Staff Jobs Adjunct Jobs Temporary Jobs Student Jobs Applicant FAQs My Application Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Please review job requirements carefully. Failure to submit all pieces of the application may result in disqualification. Applications are accepted on the University of West Florida career site . For assistance contact UWF Human Resources at 850.474.2694 or jobs@uwf.edu . OPS Recreation - Pool Pensacola - Main Campus, Florida, United States Recreation Services Temporary Temporary Closing on: Apr 15 2027 POSITION DETAILS Employment based visa sponsorship will NOT be considered for this position. Classification Title: Other Professional (Support/Service) Department: Recreation Services FLSA Status: Non-Exempt Salary Range: $15.00 - $20.00 Pay Basis: Hourly POSITION OVERVIEW JOB SUMMARY: The Recreation Services department is collecting applications for part-time, temporary positions in their area. The positions may range from support in the following areas: Intramurals, Outdoor Adventures, Aquatics, Fitness Center, Recreation Facilities, and other areas as needed. Some positions may require certifications and the hiring manager will discuss. Please list any training and/or certifications you possess on your application. These certifications may include: CPR, AED, Lay Responder First Aid, Lifeguard, etc. MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS: Excellent customer service skills. POSITION QUALIFICATIONS: Excellent customer service skills. Special Requirements or Considerations of the Job: This position requires a criminal background screening. This position requires fingerprinting. Special Instructions to Applicants: Candidates must apply online through the University of West Florida website: https://careers.uwf.edu. Applicants are required to attach a resume, cover letter and contact information for three references. An opportunity to upload these documents will be provided during the application process. For assistance, please contact Human Resources at 850.474.2694 or email jobs@uwf.edu. The Recreation Services department is collecting applications for part-time, temporary positions in their area. Applications will be accepted on an on-going basis. The positions may range from support in the following areas: Intramurals, Outdoor Adventures, Aquatics, Fitness Center, Recreation Facilities, and other areas as needed. Some positions may require certifications and the hiring manager will discuss. Please list any training and/or certifications you possess on your application. These certifications may include: CPR, AED, Lay Responder First Aid, Lifeguard, etc. Certifications required for some positions. Examples include: Lay Responder First Aid, CPR and AED Certification. Must be able to complete them before start date, if required for the position offered. ADDITIONAL POSTING DETAILS Number of Vacancies: Multiple Work Hours: Varies, dependent upon position FTE: 0.25 Closing Date: 4/15/2027 The University of West Florida is an Equal Opportunity/Access/Disabled/Veteran employer. Any individual requiring special accommodation to apply is requested to advise UWF by contacting UWF Human Resources at 850.474.2694. E-Verify is required for employment. All applications for employment at the University are subject to Florida public records law. Apply First Name (required) 657ebd98 Last Name (required) 24ec72f1 Email (required) 4b82b00f Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Apply Now First Name (required) 8d959489 Last Name (required) 213ac85b Email (required) d7c117f2 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you FOLLOW US Accessibility Equal Opportunity About This Site Contact Copyright © 2026 The University of West Florida All Rights Reserved | Disclaimer and Privacy Candidate Details This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personal