    "https://careers.uwf.edu/jobs/ops-noncredit-instructor-leadership-management-pool-pensacola-main-campus-florida-united-states": {
      "title": "OPS Noncredit Instructor, Leadership & Management",
      "description": "OPS Noncredit Instructor, Leadership & Management - Pool - Pensacola - Main Campus, Florida, United States My settings Life at UWF About UWF UWF News Pensacola Area Benefits Wellness Program Search Jobs Job Alerts Faculty Jobs Staff Jobs Adjunct Jobs Temporary Jobs Student Jobs Applicant FAQs My Application Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Please review job requirements carefully. Failure to submit all pieces of the application may result in disqualification. Applications are accepted on the University of West Florida career site . For assistance contact UWF Human Resources at 850.474.2694 or jobs@uwf.edu . OPS Noncredit Instructor, Leadership & Management - Pool Pensacola - Main Campus, Florida, United States Continuing Education Temporary Temporary Closing on: Jan 11 2027 POSITION DETAILS Employment based visa sponsorship will NOT be considered for this position. Classification Title: Executive/Administrative/Managerial Working Title: Professional Development Instructor, Leadership & Management Department: Continuing Education FLSA Status: Non-Exempt Salary Range: Commensurate with education and experience Pay Basis: Annually POSITION OVERVIEW JOB SUMMARY: The Professional Development Instructor, Leadership & Management designs, delivers, and evaluates professional development programs that build effective management and leadership skills within organizations. This role supports both noncredit open enrollment offerings and customized, contracted programs for professional clients, ensuring each program is relevant, engaging, and tied to measurable outcomes. Key Responsibilities Develop curricula, learning materials, facilitator guides, and participant resources grounded in adult learning principles Customize content for contracted clients to reflect their industry, culture, and strategic priorities Facilitate workshops and training sessions on topics such as supervision, communication, conflict resolution, emotional intelligence, change management, coaching, strategic thinking, and team development Create an interactive learning environment that encourages application of skills on the job MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS: Bachelor’s degree in Human Resources, Education, Business Administration, Psychology, or a related field. POSITION QUALIFICATIONS: Bachelor’s degree in Human Resources, Education, Business Administration, Psychology, or a related field Four years of experience delivering leadership training in a corporate or organizational setting Demonstrated knowledge of leadership and management theory and adult learning principles Strong facilitation, presentation, and interpersonal skills PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS: Master's degree in a related field Professional certifications such as CPTD, SHRM-CP/SCP, ATD, PMP, or coaching credentials (ICF) Special Requirements or Considerations of the Job: This position requires a criminal background screening. Special Instructions to Applicants: Candidates must apply online through the University of West Florida website: https://careers.uwf.edu. Applicants are required to attach a resume, cover letter and contact information for three references. An opportunity to upload these documents will be provided during the application process. For assistance, please contact Human Resources at 850.474.2694 or email jobs@uwf.edu. ADDITIONAL POSTING DETAILS Number of Vacancies: Multiple Work Hours: Varies FTE: 0.10 Closing Date: 01/11/2027 The University of West Florida is an Equal Opportunity/Access/Disabled/Veteran employer. Any individual requiring special accommodation to apply is requested to advise UWF by contacting UWF Human Resources at 850.474.2694. E-Verify is required for employment. All applications for employment at the University are subject to Florida public records law. Apply First Name (required) facccd31 Last Name (required) 0c3b3e18 Email (required) cfd92f40 Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Apply Now First Name (required) d3a99859 Last Name (required) de1b7772 